Conjures up a bolt of shadowflame that moves toward the target and explodes into a flash of darkness and fire, doing [67, 90, 108, 123, 136 (TL1-5; SP 100)] fire damage and [67, 90, 108, 123, 136 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness damage in a radius of [2, 3, 4, 5, 6 (TL1-5)].

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
